# kzgcc_v4.kzs -- logical sites of the kzgcc kzs-sites 4 test (kzgcc 0.4, docs/event_semantics.md 13.6).  Generic names,
# unit-test values; not a cFS manifest and not research conditions.  Lines and columns are those of kzgcc_v4.c (the
# columns as clang states them: the nested call of line 17 is at column 13, where GCC states 8).
kzs-sites 4
